<title>FRANCE: Frenchman kills policeman, himself.</title>
<headline>Frenchman kills policeman, himself.</headline>
<dateline>SANT-NAZAIRE, France 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Frenchman on Thursday shot dead a policeman who called to deliver a summons and then shot himself, police said.</p>
<p>Police captain Michel Dreano, 52, died in hospital of chest wounds in the western port of Saint-Nazaire and police who stormed the flat found the body of the unnamed man.</p>
